499	### Task 3: Agent runtime
500	
501	**Files:** `packages/agent/src/**`, `packages/agent/test/**`
502	
503	**Interfaces:**
504	- Consumes: `Env`, `BudgetExceededError` from `@dailies/core`.
505	- Produces:
506	```ts
